The top natural tier at 1ct is the [D-VVS2 GIA at $3,594](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29587972?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — colorless, near-flawless, the certificate-maximum choice for buyers who want the grade to be part of the gift's meaning.

